@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Bigmemory a owl:Class.
hpc:Switch a owl:Class.
hpc:Appalicense a owl:Class.

hpc:hasbigmemory a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasswitch a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:hasappalicense a owl:ObjectProperty.

hpc:Bigmemory rdfs:domain hpc:Host.
hpc:Switch rdfs:domain hpc:Host.
hpc:Appalicense rdfs:domain hpc:Host.

hpc:Hasbigmemory rdfs:range xsd:boolean.
hpc:Hasswitch rdfs:range xsd:string.
hpc:Hasappalicense rdfs:
